---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const details = await getCollection("details");
---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Minimal Match 3 Privacy Policy"}
  description={"Minimal Match 3 Privacy Policy - " +
    details[0].data.name +
    " - " +
    "Standard Match 3 – but with minimal distractions. Play match 3 the way it was intended."}
>
  <section id="m3privacy" class="relative pt-20 pb-32">
    <div class="z-10 relative mx-auto px-6 container">
      <div
        class="flex justify-center items-center mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[1320px] text-center align-middle"
      >
        <h1
          id="privacy-policy"
          class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 font-bold text-3xl md:text-4xl text-center"
        >
          Minimal Match 3 <br />Privacy Policy
        </h1>
      </div>
      <div id="privacy-content" class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl">
        <h2 class="mt-4" id="overview">Privacy Policy Overview</h2>
        <p>
          It is Derek Perry’s policy to respect your privacy regarding any
          information Derek Perry may collect while operating the game, Minimal
          Match 3. This Privacy Policy applies to <a href="/m3"
            >Minimal Match 3</a
          > (hereinafter, “the game”, “Derek Perry's game”, or “<a href="/m3"
            >Minimal Match 3</a
          >”). Derek Perry respects your privacy and is committed to protecting
          personally identifiable information you may provide Derek Perry
          through the game. Derek Perry has adopted this privacy policy
          (“Privacy Policy”) to explain what information may be collected in the
          game, how Derek Perry uses this information, and under what
          circumstances Derek Perry may disclose the information to third
          parties. This Privacy Policy applies only to information Derek Perry
          collects through the game and does not apply to the collection of
          information from other sources.
        </p>
        <p>
          This Privacy Policy sets forth the general rules and policies
          governing your experience with the game. Depending on your activities
          when playing the game, you may be required to agree to additional
          terms and conditions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="user-data">Game User Data</h2>
        <p>
          Like most game developers, Derek Perry collects
          non-personally-identifying information of the sort that devices and
          servers typically make available, such as the device/device type,
          language preference, and the date and time of each user request. Derek
          Perry’s purpose in collecting non-personally identifying information
          is to better understand how Derek Perry’s game users play/use the
          game. From time to time, Derek Perry may release
          non-personally-identifying information in the aggregate, e.g., by
          publishing a report on trends in the usage of the game.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="gathering-info">
          Gathering of Personally-Identifying Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          Certain users of Derek Perry’s games choose to interact with Derek
          Perry in ways that require Derek Perry to gather
          personally-identifying information. The amount and type of information
          that Derek Perry gathers depends on the nature of the interaction.
          Derek Perry runs analytics to understand how you interact with the
          game which should continuously improve your gaming experience (e.g.
          identifying that a feature is too difficult for most users).
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="security">Security</h2>
        <p>
          The security of your Personal Information is important to Derek Perry,
          but remember that no method of transmission over the Internet, or
          method of electronic storage is 100% secure. While Derek Perry strives
          to use commercially acceptable means to protect your Personal
          Information, Derek Perry cannot guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="child-data">Personal Data Concerning Children</h2>
        <p>
          Derek Perry does not knowingly collect any personal data concerning
          children under 16 years old. In the unlikely event that Derek Perry
          has (or you believe Derek Perry has) collected information from a
          child, please contact Derek Perry by using the contact info at the
          bottom of this privacy policy. Derek Perry will take all necessary
          steps to purge the data from relevant systems.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="external-links">Links To External Sites</h2>
        <p>
          This game may contain links to external sites that are not operated by
          Derek Perry. If you click on a third party link, you will be directed
          to that third party’s site. Derek Perry strongly advises you to review
          the Privacy Policy and terms and conditions of every site you visit.
        </p>
        <p>
          Derek Perry has no control over, and assumes no responsibility for the
          content, privacy policies or practices of any third party sites,
          products or services.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="info-protection">
          Protection of Certain Personally-Identifying Information
        </h2>
        <p>
          Derek Perry discloses potentially personally-identifying and
          personally-identifying information only to those of employees,
          contractors and affiliated organizations that (i) need to know that
          information in order to process it on Derek Perry’s behalf or to
          provide services available at Derek Perry’s game, and (ii) that have
          agreed not to disclose it to others. Some of those employees,
          contractors and affiliated organizations may be located outside of
          your home country; by using Derek Perry’s game, you consent to the
          transfer of such information to them. Derek Perry will not rent or
          sell potentially personally-identifying and personally-identifying
          information to anyone. Other than to employees, contractors and
          affiliated organizations, as described above, Derek Perry discloses
          potentially personally-identifying and personally-identifying
          information only in response to a subpoena, court order or other
          governmental request, or when Derek Perry believes in good faith that
          disclosure is reasonably necessary to protect the property or rights
          of Derek Perry, third parties or the public at large.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you send Derek Perry a request (for example via a support email or
          via one of the feedback mechanisms), Derek Perry reserves the right to
          store it privately in order to help clarify or respond to your
          request. Derek Perry takes all measures reasonably necessary to
          protect against the unauthorized access, use, alteration or
          destruction of potentially personally-identifying and
          personally-identifying information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="statistics">Aggregated Statistics</h2>
        <p>
          Derek Perry may collect statistics about the behavior of users in the
          game. Derek Perry may display this information publicly or provide it
          to others. However, Derek Perry does not disclose your
          personally-identifying information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="transfers">Business Transfers</h2>
        <p>
          If Derek Perry, or substantially all of his assets, were acquired, or
          in the unlikely event that Derek Perry goes out of business or enters
          bankruptcy, user information would be one of the assets that is
          transferred or acquired by a third party. You acknowledge that such
          transfers may occur, and that any acquirer of Derek Perry may continue
          to use your personal information as set forth in this policy.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="changes">Privacy Policy Changes</h2>
        <p>
          Although most changes are likely to be minor, Derek Perry may change
          this Privacy Policy from time to time, and in Derek Perry’s sole
          discretion. Derek Perry encourages users to frequently check this page
          for any changes to this Privacy Policy. Your continued use of this
          site after any change in this Privacy Policy will constitute your
          acceptance of such change.
        </p>
        <p><i>This Privacy Policy was last updated on September 27, 2025.</i></p>

        <h2 class="mt-4" id="contact-info">Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
          via the contact information and/or social media links below:
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
